     try:\n            mailbox = self._team_manager.get_mailbox(self.team_name)\n            if mailbox is None:\n                return\n            messages = mailbox.consume(self.agent_id)\n            for msg in messages:\n                prefix = f\"[Message from {msg.from_agent}]\"\n                if msg.message_type != \"text\":\n                    prefix = f\"[{msg.message_type} from {msg.from_agent}]\"\n                content = f\"{prefix} {msg.content}\"\n                conversation.add_user_message(content)\n        except Exception as e:\n            log.debug(\"Mailbox consumption failed: %s\", e)\n\n--- 来源 arclight:72f29b36ac7c16783c2dfdc7 结束 ---\n\n[来源 arclight:7b64f29fc9f94c9febdf6fb0] Arclight · implementation / implemented / draft · mewcode/teams/manager.py:221-239，字符 7403-8111\n--- 来源 arclight:7b64f29fc9f94c9febdf6fb0 开始 ---\n    def drain_lead_mailbox(self) -> list[str]:\n        notes: list[str] = []\n        for team_name in list(self._teams.keys()):\n            team = self.get_team(team_name)\n            if team is None:\n                continue\n            mailbox = self.get_mailbox(team_name)\n            if mailbox is None:\n                continue\n            msgs = mailbox.consume(team.lead_agent_id)\n            if not msgs:\n                continue\n            parts = [f'<team-notification team=\"{team_name}\">']\n            for m in msgs:\n                parts.append(f\"from={m.from_agent}: {m.content}\")\n            parts.append(\"</team-notification>\")\n            notes.append(\"\\n\".join(parts))\n        return notes\n\n--- 来源 arclight:7b64f29fc9f94c9febdf6fb0 结束 ---\n\n[来源 arc-15] Arclight · limitation / unverified / source-claim · handoff/qa/arc-15.md:1-5\n--- 来源 arc-15 开始 ---\n[REFERENCE / source-claim / unverified_reference] Mailbox consume 是事务 ACK 吗？\n当前 Mailbox 是文件消息机制，读取、处理、删除之间不构成完整事务 ACK，不能保证处理副作用与删除原子一致。若要提高可靠性，可以引入领取、处理中、确认与重投协议，再配合幂等处理；这是改进方案。\n边界：明确当前实现边界，不把拟议协议说成已实现。\n边界：附件问答为设计与实现参考；具体当前代码实现以独立源码证据为准。\n追问：读后进程崩溃？；删除失败？；重复消息如何识别？\n来源：handoff/data/project_profile_seed.json#question_answers[id=arc-15]@afbd241fbeda0cec85f7592f65399426ed30cedb4e8e0a64a45e9ef716d54773\n--- 来源 arc-15 结束 ---\n=== 项目资料结束 ==="
